02a9d180ffe8d36f8adda43f5e4a9bf0c1:4;\" style=\"width:70.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:fc1b1e32983321d5afcd9416ba98c44bd0dc3e266e02f28ca0179cd9e0a24445:5;\" style=\"width:73.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">配制。常温下，<img src=\"chem-asset:48f333c5fe9e31c419654097ffc806a8ae0e212bcd91f9db2d3a849f79695867:6;\" style=\"width:106.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">与<img src=\"chem-asset:7d3e687e0e448750e852f60f2d03346591953739ff61ebd8d4ded703cce0471a:7;\" style=\"width:29.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">形成可溶于水的配离子：<img src=\"chem-asset:60283687f12bae3c163338e6f8e57e67c7c5a04bdc9228a2668b0b646503f612:8;\" style=\"width:134.73px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">；<img src=\"chem-asset:e5e48d89e2107d99cc3f5a16222c4dfdd879d5294c4fde28e17f92b56d2630a0:9;\" style=\"width:54.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">易被空气氧化为<img src=\"chem-asset:ebfaeecaf6a2c6b5f6469cf1d1655f09128af4323a94351e843be8c54fcf4b97:10;\" style=\"width:54.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">；部分氢氧化物的<img src=\"chem-asset:8f484ef781003ed7040c78667b77af4d77e872722125990eba13da51832910ed:11;\" style=\"width:22.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">如下表。</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>氢氧化物</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><img src=\"chem-asset:e5e48d89e2107d99cc3f5a16222c4dfdd879d5294c4fde28e17f92b56d2630a0:9;\" style=\"width:54.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><img src=\"chem-asset:ebfaeecaf6a2c6b5f6469cf1d1655f09128af4323a94351e843be8c54fcf4b97:10;\" style=\"width:54.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><img src=\"chem-asset:4fd181b20fa26631b8e51efc105774b514eff41c3e79fbccc83129b2e923bc67:12;\" style=\"width:52.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><img src=\"chem-asset:318b985066c2f50f2b807d7cbe669acedcdadf506aa40bcffe6bc24ab9a780ae:13;\" style=\